{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"847","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"C. Sum of Nestings"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Recall that the bracket sequence is considered regular if it is possible to insert symbols '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"+"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' and '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' into it so that the result is a correct arithmetic expression. For example, a sequence \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"(()())"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" is regular, because we can get correct arithmetic expression insering symbols '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"+"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' and '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"': \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"((1+1)+(1+1))"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\". Also the following sequences are regular: \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"()()()"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"(())"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"()"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\". The following sequences are not regular bracket sequences: \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":")("}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"(()"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"())(()"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In this problem you are given two integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":". Your task is to construct a regular bracket sequence consisting of round brackets with length "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2·n"},{"kind":"text","text":" with total sum of nesting of all opening brackets equals to exactly "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":". The nesting of a single opening bracket equals to the number of pairs of brackets in which current opening bracket is embedded."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For example, in the sequence \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"()(())"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" the nesting of first opening bracket equals to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0"},{"kind":"text","text":", the nesting of the second opening bracket equals to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0"},{"kind":"text","text":" and the nesting of the third opening bracket equal to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":". So the total sum of nestings equals to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains two integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ n ≤ 3·105"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0 ≤ k ≤ 1018"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the number of opening brackets and needed total nesting."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print the required regular bracket sequence consisting of round brackets."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If there is no solution print \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Impossible"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" (without quotes)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3 1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"()(())"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4 6\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"(((())))"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2 5\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"Impossible\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first example is examined in the statement."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second example the answer is \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"(((())))"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\". The nesting of the first opening bracket is "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0"},{"kind":"text","text":", the nesting of the second is "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":", the nesting of the third is "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2"},{"kind":"text","text":", the nesting of fourth is "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"3"},{"kind":"text","text":". So the total sum of nestings equals to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0 + 1 + 2 + 3 = 6"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the third it is impossible to construct a regular bracket sequence, because the maximum possible total sum of nestings for two opening brackets equals to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":". This total sum of nestings is obtained for the sequence \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"(())"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"C","problemCode":"847C","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/847/problem/C"}